; The one variable: the outline_size of a ProgressBar percentage in the bundled font, at font sizes 16 and 48.
; The ring is a stroked contour of radius outline_size / 4 px, drawn before the text
; (`progress_bar.cpp:180-181`). The bundled font keeps the fill on the atlas and strokes the ring on the canvas
; painter (ADR-0040). The atlas field holds only about 2.3 px of outline at size 48, so an outline_size of 16 shows
; whether the ring is a stroke or a filled quad. `progress-bar-outline-variation` sets a scene font, which strokes its
; own ring, and `progress-bar-embolden-fill` sets no outline, so neither draws a bundled-font ring.

